1
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:04,660
Hey, thanks for helping me
test my subtitle generator.

2
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:08,060
No problem. What do I have to do?

3
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:10,380
Just talk normally.

4
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:13,740
The program listens and writes
everything as subtitles.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:18,180
Okay. Does it also know who is speaking?

6
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,660
No, that's one of the limitations.

7
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:25,420
It only writes the words,
not the names of the speakers.

8
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:30,540
Interesting. So if we both
talk at the same time...

9
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:32,090
Then it probably gets confused.

10
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:35,820
Let's see how it handles that.

11
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:38,680
Okay. Thank you for helping me out.

